1
00:00:00,786 --> 00:00:02,946
(Sheldon:)That's ridiculous.

2
00:00:03,122 --> 00:00:05,352
(Sheldon:)I am one of the great minds
of our generation.

3
00:00:05,558 --> 00:00:09,118
(Sheldon:)I work on a level so rarified,
you couldn't even imagine it.

4
00:00:09,295 --> 00:00:11,825
(Sheldon:)I said, stop looking at my cool train!

5
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:18,267
Hm. A strange place to put a picture
of you and Bernadette.

6
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:23,045
Well, I've wanted everybody
to know I love my wife, you know...

7
00:00:23,209 --> 00:00:26,369
(Howard:)...and nobody to know
I forgot to turn off the laser.

8
00:00:31,017 --> 00:00:33,607
(Raj:)They're here.
Our action figures have arrived.

9
00:00:33,786 --> 00:00:36,216
It's the best $500 I've ever spent.

10
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:39,882
(Leonard:)A thousand dollars on action figures?
How can you afford that?

11
00:00:40,092 --> 00:00:43,062
Easy. His family is loaded
and Bernadette has a great job.

12
00:00:43,229 --> 00:00:46,099
My wife came with both funbags
and moneybags.

13
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:52,740
Say hello to an exact-scale model of me.

14
00:00:57,143 --> 00:01:00,133
(Raj:)Oh, I'm not dark chocolate.

